<title>ZIMBABWE: SOCCER-ZIMBABWE BEAT ANGOLA 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZIMBABWE BEAT ANGOLA 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat Angola 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in their African Nations Cup group one qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Wilfred Mugeyi 31 pen</p>
<p>    Standings    Pl   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Ghana		2   1   1   0   2   1    4</p>
<p> Zimbabwe	   2   1   1   0   1   0    4</p>
<p> Angola	     2   0   0   2   1   3    0</p>
<p>Next match: June 22 - Angola v Ghana, in Luanda</p>
</text>
